<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Home Fix Metal Works</title>
<style>
body{
font-family:Arial,sans-serif;
margin:0;
background:#f5f5f5;
color:#333;
}
header{
background:#222;
color:white;
padding:30px;
text-align:center;
}
nav{
background:#444;
padding:10px;
text-align:center;
}
nav a{
color:white;
text-decoration:none;
margin:15px;
font-weight:bold;
}
section{
padding:20px;
}
.services{
display:grid;
grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(200px,1fr));
gap:15px;
}
.card{
background:white;
padding:15px;
border-radius:8px;
box-shadow:0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
}
footer{
background:#222;
color:white;
text-align:center;
padding:15px;
margin-top:20px;
}
.phone{
font-size:22px;
color:#d32f2f;
font-weight:bold;
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
<h1>Home Fix Metal Works</h1>
<p>Professional Welding & Metal Fabrication</p>
</header>

<nav>
<a href="#services">Services</a>
<a href="#contact">Contact</a>
</nav>

<section id="services">
<h2>Our Services</h2>

<div class="services">
<div class="card">
<h3>Welding</h3>
<p>Professional welding for homes and businesses.</p>
</div>

<div class="card">
<h3>Metal Fabrication</h3>
<p>Custom fabrication of all metal products.</p>
</div>

<div class="card">
<h3>Steel Doors & Gates</h3>
<p>Strong and secure steel doors and gates.</p>
</div>

<div class="card">
<h3>Windows</h3>
<p>Quality steel windows made to your measurements.</p>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section id="contact">
<h2>Contact Us</h2>
<p class="phone">0723206320</p>
<p>Call or WhatsApp us today.</p>
</section>

<footer>
© 2026 Home Fix Metal Works. All Rights Reserved.
</footer>

</body>
</html>
